{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12105060","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105060","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1210506001:1":{"text":"怎么这么快就下来了？房间有问题？","source_cn":"怎么这么快就下来了？房间有问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F430CACFA57E17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210506002:1":{"text":"辛巴达，我们被波尔斯坑骗，被举报成水鬼，原来都是你在背后搞的鬼？","source_cn":"辛巴达，我们被波尔斯坑骗，被举报成水鬼，原来都是你在背...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E602137D7C26AD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210506003:1":{"text":"你们……听到了？","source_cn":"你们……听到了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC099F6381982D34A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1210506003":{"text":"你们……听到了？","source_cn":"你们……听到了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC099F6381982D34A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210506004:1":{"text":"为什么要骗我们，你救了满满，我……我想把你当朋友的！","source_cn":"为什么要骗我们，你救了满满，我……我想把你当朋友的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55388EC0170E4A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210506005:1":{"tex